OL,3,GNEWSABryant orders independent review
OL,4,Aof Parades Commission
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission will be allowed
OL,7,Fto continue its work without changes to
OL,8,Fits membership, Northern Ireland
OL,9,FSecretary of State Sir Chris Bryant has
OL,10,Fannounced.
OL,12,FInstead of changes, he has ordered an
OL,13,Findependent review of the commission.
OL,15,FThere have been calls for the
OL,16,Fcommissioners to lose their posts as a
OL,17,Fresult of a recent court case that
OL,18,Fexposed flaws in some of their
OL,19,Fprocedures around a proposed Orange
OL,20,FOrder parade in Portadown in July.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
