OL,3,GNEWSABryant orders independent review
OL,4,Aof Parades Commission
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission said it welcomed
OL,7,Fthe secretary of state's support for
OL,8,Fits commissioners and "will cooperate
OL,9,Ffully" with the independent review.
